## How it works
1. Once user submits request via registration form in the portal, a record gets created in the 'Training Registrations' table.
2. This flow gets triggered and checks if the user has a manager.
3. An email gets triggered to the manager requesting approval or rejection.
4. If approved, an email is triggered to the user and status of the registration gets updated to 'approved'.
5. If rejected, an email will still be triggered to the user and the status of the registration gets updated to 'rejected'.

